{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to SCULPT. </h2>'Sculpt' comprises 30+ meticulously crafted puzzles in a 3D grid-based game solvable through logic. When sculpting, focus on your left; carve outward on your side of the screen. It starts easy but gets tougher as you progress. Make a duck or sculpt out a castle. Some levels feature bomb blocks for faster progress but come with the risk of ruining your sculpt. Or demonstrate your mastery by completing each sculpture within a time limit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540480/extras/7d008e7671e6a4028241c885df009814.poster.avif?t=1697090687\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540480/extras/7d008e7671e6a4028241c885df009814.webm?t=1697090687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540480/extras/7d008e7671e6a4028241c885df009814.mp4?t=1697090687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><strong>\u2022     Make use of the 3D environment by rotating SCULPT in its isometric direction.</strong><br><strong>\u2022     Over 30+ sculpt puzzles to solve.</strong><br><strong>\u2022     Use bomb blocks to make things go BOOM.</strong><br><strong>\u2022     Test your skills in time attack; complete a sculpture before the time is up.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540480/extras/a13095e337dba0fdefe41717286ae691.poster.avif?t=1697090687\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540480/extras/a13095e337dba0fdefe41717286ae691.webm?t=1697090687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak